bmdwire is one distribution carrying four differently licensed packages.
Each package directory holds the licence that governs everything under it,
and an installed copy ships all of them:

  atemwire/       LGPL-3.0-only  (a fork of pyatem; see atemwire/LICENSE,
                                  atemwire/LICENSE-gpl3.txt and atemwire/NOTICE)
  hyperdeckwire/  MIT            (hyperdeckwire/LICENSE)
  ultimattewire/  MIT            (ultimattewire/LICENSE)
  videohubwire/   MIT            (videohubwire/LICENSE)

Everything else in this repository (the workflows, this file, the brand
assets under docs/) is MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Lucas Romanenko.

